tion. v2.3.1-rc was healthy only in staging, so I didn't use it.\n- **Result:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate dropped from 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident INC-0001 (SEV2):** It says v2.3.1 failed health checks, that I rolled back to v2.3.0, and what the service looks like now. It also says the next step is to find out why v2.3.1 failed before anyone redeploys it.", "type": "text"}]}]}